  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed single storey rear extension by reason of its size, siting and depth would have an overbearing effect upon the adjoining property No.31 Kings Road, through loss of light, outlook and sense of enclosure detrimental to the amenities of the adjoining neighbouring occupier contrary to Core Strategy CP30 and Development Management Document Policies DMD8, DMD11 and DMD37.\r\r",
    "Insufficient information has been submitted to fully consider the impacts of the development on flood risk, having regard to its siting in proximity to flood zone 2  and 3 and in the absence of a comprehensive site specific Drainage Strategy, the applicant has thereby failed to ensure that the site is safe from flooding or does not increase the risks of flooding elsewhere. The proposals are thereby contrary to policies DMD59, DMD60 and DMD62 of the Development Management Document (2014), CP28 of the Core Strategy (2010) and the advice contained within the NPPF (2021).\r\r"
  ],
